{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_528_rs_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_528_rs_04_1009_046rio", "source_sha256": "db0c108ebbed0e143c1b74b6b1fd528ed7c51c9aa83f1bc955dc06e3f2c58e2e", "ja": "会場のみんなも、劇場のみんなも……。\nそれから……{$P$}くんも。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
